    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">and I'm floating (in a most peculiar way)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Slowly but surely, Catra became what her friends called a â€œspace-nerdâ€, but she wasnâ€™t ashamed of the title. Space was her first love, and her secondâ€”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œWhat are you reading?â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€”was that blonde goof who one day, entirely unprompted, sat opposite her in Razzâ€™s diner and asked her what she was reading.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>IorekoftheHorde</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
